<title>MEXICO: Mexico to invest in water system - Zedillo.</title>
<headline>Mexico to invest in water system - Zedillo.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's President Ernesto Zedillo unveiled on Monday a program for 7.145 billion pesos from now to the year 2000 to manage and clean up the country's water resources.</p>
<p>The program aims to provide drinking water to 10 million people by the year 2000 and sewage facilities to another 14 million, he added.</p>
<p>&quot;Mexico's development will not be viable or sustainable so long as we do not solve the problem of water management and cleaning up all water basins in the country,&quot; Zedillo said.</p>
<p>((--Debora Montesinos, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7913))</p>
